the same env names Aspire injects) and drives `ServiceApp.fetch()`: contract health 200 public;
11 unauthenticated paths → 401; usage-only credential → 403 on four read surfaces; runs:read-only
credential → 403 on create/decide; **operator credential → 403 on `void` (finance:admin role
gate)**; unknown token → 401; the old doubled path denied. The guarded-200 path is proven live
against the running services (operator → 200 on `/api/invoices`, web token → 200 on `/api/runs`).
